Every opioid-taper can continue during some months and can continue during some years.
If a patient has an opioid-taper and has an opioid-dosage then it is possible that the opioid-taper has a duration that depends on the opioid-dosage.
If a patient has an opioid-taper and has a patient-goal then every clinician should individualize the opioid-taper with the patient-goal.
If a patient has an opioid-taper and has a patient-concern then every clinician should individualize the opioid-taper with the patient-concern.
